# Nothing ignored. An exclusion goes here only for a finding that has no fix we can ship: give it a comment saying
# why and an expiry (exp:YYYY-MM-DD), so the scan fails again and somebody looks. Mirror it in .grype.yaml.
#
# The vendored `trivy` binary used to need some: its releases lag behind the Go and x/net fixes. The Dockerfile now
# builds it from source with a patched toolchain and dependencies instead (trivy-build stage).
